sentences.text:
9. The trial Court is directed to release the petitioner/accused on bail in Crime No.386/2021, subject to the following conditions:-
i) Petitioner shall execute personal bond in a sum of Rs.2,00,000/- (Rupees Two Lakhs only) with two sureties for likesum to the satisfaction of the trial Court;
ii) Petitioner shall not tamper with the prosecution witnesses directly or indirectly;
iii) Petitioner shall not indulge himself in similar offences strictly;
iv) Petitioner shall take the trial without causing any delay; and v) Petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of this Court without prior permission.
If any of the conditions are violated, the prosecution is at liberty to file an application for cancellation of bail.

